#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: sidebar_label
#, no-wrap
msgid "Equivalence of the representations"
msgstr "Kesetaraan perwakilan"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"{/* cspell:ignore operatorname */}\n"
"{/* cspell:ignore orthogonalization */}\n"
"{/* cspell:ignore vectorizing */}\n"
"{/* cspell:ignore bilinearity */}\n"
msgstr ""
"{/* cspell:ignore operatorname */}\n"
"{/* cspell:ignore orthogonalization */}\n"
"{/* cspell:ignore vectorizing */}\n"
"{/* cspell:ignore bilinearity */}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We've now discussed three different ways to represent channels in mathematical terms, namely Stinespring representations, Kraus representations, and Choi representations.\n"
"We also have the definition of a channel, which states that a channel is a linear mapping that always transforms density matrices into density matrices, even when the channel is applied to just part of a compound system.\n"
"The remainder of the lesson is devoted to a mathematical proof that the three representations are equivalent and precisely capture the definition.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita telah membincangkan tiga cara berbeza untuk mewakili saluran dalam istilah matematik, iaitu perwakilan Stinespring, perwakilan Kraus, dan perwakilan Choi.\n"
"Kita juga mempunyai takrifan saluran, yang menyatakan bahawa saluran ialah pemetaan linear yang sentiasa mengubah matriks ketumpatan menjadi matriks ketumpatan, walaupun apabila saluran itu digunakan hanya pada sebahagian sistem kompaun.\n"
"Bahagian selebihnya pelajaran ini ditumpukan kepada bukti matematik bahawa ketiga-tiga perwakilan adalah setara dan menangkap takrifan dengan tepat.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Overview of the proof {#overview-of-the-proof}"
msgstr "Gambaran keseluruhan bukti {#overview-of-the-proof}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Our goal is to establish the equivalence of a collection of four statements, and we'll begin by writing them down precisely.\n"
"All four statements follow the same conventions that have been used throughout the lesson, namely that $\\Phi$ is a linear mapping from square matrices to square matrices, the rows and columns of the input matrices have been placed in correspondence with the classical states of a system $\\mathsf{X}$ (the input system), and the rows and columns of the output matrices have been placed in correspondence with the classical states of a system $\\mathsf{Y}$ (the output system).\n"
msgstr ""
"Matlamat kita adalah untuk menetapkan kesetaraan koleksi empat pernyataan, dan kita akan mulakan dengan menulisnya dengan tepat.\n"
"Keempat-empat pernyataan mengikut konvensyen yang sama yang telah digunakan sepanjang pelajaran ini, iaitu $\\Phi$ ialah pemetaan linear daripada matriks persegi kepada matriks persegi, baris dan lajur matriks input telah ditempatkan dalam perkaitan dengan keadaan klasik sistem $\\mathsf{X}$ (sistem input), dan baris dan lajur matriks output telah ditempatkan dalam perkaitan dengan keadaan klasik sistem $\\mathsf{Y}$ (sistem output).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$\\Phi$ is a channel from $\\mathsf{X}$ to $\\mathsf{Y}.$ That is, $\\Phi$ "
"always transforms density matrices to density matrices, even when it acts on"
" one part of a larger compound system.\n"
msgstr ""
"$\\Phi$ ialah saluran daripada $\\mathsf{X}$ kepada $\\mathsf{Y}.$ Yakni, "
"$\\Phi$ sentiasa mengubah matriks ketumpatan menjadi matriks ketumpatan, "
"walaupun apabila ia bertindak pada satu bahagian sistem kompaun yang lebih "
"besar.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Choi matrix $J(\\Phi)$ is positive semidefinite and satisfies the "
"condition $\\operatorname{Tr}_{\\mathsf{Y}}(J(\\Phi)) = "
"\\mathbb{I}_{\\mathsf{X}}.$\n"
msgstr ""
"Matriks Choi $J(\\Phi)$ adalah separuh-tentu positif dan memenuhi syarat "
"$\\operatorname{Tr}_{\\mathsf{Y}}(J(\\Phi)) = \\mathbb{I}_{\\mathsf{X}}.$\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"There is a Kraus representation for $\\Phi.$ That is, there exist matrices "
"$A_0,\\ldots,A_{N-1}$ for which the equation $\\Phi(\\rho) = \\sum_{k = "
"0}^{N-1} A_k \\rho A_k^{\\dagger}$ is true for every input $\\rho,$ and that"
" satisfy the condition $\\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} A_k^{\\dagger} A_k = "
"\\mathbb{I}_{\\mathsf{X}}.$\n"
msgstr ""
"Terdapat perwakilan Kraus bagi $\\Phi.$ Yakni, terdapat matriks "
"$A_0,\\ldots,A_{N-1}$ di mana persamaan $\\Phi(\\rho) = \\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} "
"A_k \\rho A_k^{\\dagger}$ benar bagi setiap input $\\rho,$ dan yang memenuhi"
" syarat $\\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} A_k^{\\dagger} A_k = "
"\\mathbb{I}_{\\mathsf{X}}.$\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"There is a Stinespring representation for $\\Phi.$ That is, there exist "
"systems $\\mathsf{W}$ and $\\mathsf{G}$ for which the pairs "
"$(\\mathsf{W},\\mathsf{X})$ and $(\\mathsf{G},\\mathsf{Y})$ have the same "
"number of classical states, along with a unitary matrix $U$ representing a "
"unitary operation from $(\\mathsf{W},\\mathsf{X})$ to "
"$(\\mathsf{G},\\mathsf{Y}),$ such that $\\Phi(\\rho) = "
"\\operatorname{Tr}_{\\mathsf{G}}\\bigl( U (\\vert 0\\rangle\\langle 0 \\vert"
" \\otimes \\rho) U^{\\dagger} \\bigr).$\n"
msgstr ""
"Terdapat perwakilan Stinespring bagi $\\Phi.$ Yakni, terdapat sistem "
"$\\mathsf{W}$ dan $\\mathsf{G}$ di mana pasangan $(\\mathsf{W},\\mathsf{X})$"
" dan $(\\mathsf{G},\\mathsf{Y})$ mempunyai bilangan keadaan klasik yang "
"sama, bersama-sama dengan matriks unitari $U$ yang mewakili operasi unitari "
"daripada $(\\mathsf{W},\\mathsf{X})$ kepada $(\\mathsf{G},\\mathsf{Y}),$ "
"supaya $\\Phi(\\rho) = \\operatorname{Tr}_{\\mathsf{G}}\\bigl( U (\\vert "
"0\\rangle\\langle 0 \\vert \\otimes \\rho) U^{\\dagger} \\bigr).$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The way the proof works is that a cycle of implications is proved:\n"
"the first statement in our list implies the second, the second implies the third, the third implies the fourth, and the fourth statement implies the first.\n"
"This establishes that all four statements are equivalent — which is to say that they're either all true or all false for a given choice of $\\Phi$ — because the implications can be followed transitively from any one statement to any other.\n"
msgstr ""
"Cara bukti berfungsi ialah kitaran implikasi dibuktikan:\n"
"pernyataan pertama dalam senarai kita membawa kepada yang kedua, yang kedua membawa kepada yang ketiga, yang ketiga membawa kepada yang keempat, dan pernyataan keempat membawa kepada yang pertama.\n"
"Ini menetapkan bahawa keempat-empat pernyataan adalah setara — yakni ia semua benar atau semua palsu bagi pilihan $\\Phi$ yang diberikan — kerana implikasi-implikasi boleh diikuti secara transitif dari mana-mana satu pernyataan ke pernyataan lain.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This is a common strategy when proving that a collection of statements are equivalent, and a useful trick to use in such a context is to set up the implications in a way that makes them as easy to prove as possible.\n"
"That is the case here — and in fact we've already encountered two of the four implications.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ini adalah strategi lazim apabila membuktikan bahawa koleksi pernyataan adalah setara, dan trik berguna untuk digunakan dalam konteks sedemikian adalah menyediakan implikasi-implikasi dengan cara yang menjadikannya semudah mungkin untuk dibuktikan.\n"
"Itulah kes di sini — dan sebenarnya kita telah pun menemui dua daripada empat implikasi.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Channels to Choi matrices {#channels-to-choi-matrices}"
msgstr "Saluran kepada matriks Choi {#channels-to-choi-matrices}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Referring to the statements listed above by their numbers, the first implication to be proved is 1 $\\Rightarrow$ 2.\n"
"This implication was already discussed in the context of the Choi state of a channel.\n"
"Here we'll summarize the mathematical details.\n"
msgstr ""
"Merujuk kepada pernyataan-pernyataan yang tersenarai di atas mengikut nombor mereka, implikasi pertama yang hendak dibuktikan ialah 1 $\\Rightarrow$ 2.\n"
"Implikasi ini telah pun dibincangkan dalam konteks keadaan Choi saluran.\n"
"Di sini kita akan merumuskan butiran matematiknya.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Assume that the classical state set of the input system $\\mathsf{X}$ is $\\Sigma$ and let $n = \\vert\\Sigma\\vert.$\n"
"Consider the situation in which $\\Phi$ is applied to the second of two copies of $\\mathsf{X}$ together in the state\n"
msgstr ""
"Andaikan set keadaan klasik sistem input $\\mathsf{X}$ ialah $\\Sigma$ dan biar $n = \\vert\\Sigma\\vert.$\n"
"Pertimbangkan situasi di mana $\\Phi$ digunakan pada yang kedua daripada dua salinan $\\mathsf{X}$ yang bersama-sama dalam keadaan\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert \\psi \\rangle = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{n}} \\sum_{a \\in \\Sigma} \\vert a \\rangle \\otimes \\vert a \\rangle,\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert \\psi \\rangle = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{n}} \\sum_{a \\in \\Sigma} \\vert a \\rangle \\otimes \\vert a \\rangle,\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "which, as a density matrix, is given by\n"
msgstr "yang, sebagai matriks ketumpatan, diberikan oleh\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert \\psi \\rangle \\langle \\psi \\vert = \\frac{1}{n} \\sum_{a,b \\in \\Sigma}\n"
"\\vert a\\rangle\\langle b \\vert \\otimes \\vert a\\rangle\\langle b \\vert.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert \\psi \\rangle \\langle \\psi \\vert = \\frac{1}{n} \\sum_{a,b \\in \\Sigma}\n"
"\\vert a\\rangle\\langle b \\vert \\otimes \\vert a\\rangle\\langle b \\vert.\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The result can be written as\n"
msgstr "Hasilnya boleh ditulis sebagai\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"(\\operatorname{Id}\\otimes \\,\\Phi) \\bigl(\\vert \\psi \\rangle \\langle \\psi \\vert\\bigr)\n"
"= \\frac{1}{n} \\sum_{a,b = 0}^{n-1} \\vert a\\rangle\\langle b \\vert \\otimes \\Phi\\bigl(\\vert a\\rangle\\langle b \\vert\\bigr)\n"
"= \\frac{J(\\Phi)}{n},\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"(\\operatorname{Id}\\otimes \\,\\Phi) \\bigl(\\vert \\psi \\rangle \\langle \\psi \\vert\\bigr)\n"
"= \\frac{1}{n} \\sum_{a,b = 0}^{n-1} \\vert a\\rangle\\langle b \\vert \\otimes \\Phi\\bigl(\\vert a\\rangle\\langle b \\vert\\bigr)\n"
"= \\frac{J(\\Phi)}{n},\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"and by the assumption that $\\Phi$ is a channel this must be a density matrix.\n"
"Like all density matrices it must be positive semidefinite, and multiplying a positive semidefinite matrix by a positive real number yields another positive semidefinite matrix, and therefore $J(\\Phi) \\geq 0.$\n"
msgstr ""
"dan berdasarkan andaian bahawa $\\Phi$ adalah saluran, ini mestilah menjadi matriks ketumpatan.\n"
"Seperti semua matriks ketumpatan ia mestilah separuh-tentu positif, dan mendarabkan matriks separuh-tentu positif dengan nombor nyata positif menghasilkan matriks separuh-tentu positif lain, dan oleh itu $J(\\Phi) \\geq 0.$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Moreover, under the assumption that $\\Phi$ is a channel, it must preserve "
"trace, and therefore\n"
msgstr ""
"Selain itu, berdasarkan andaian bahawa $\\Phi$ adalah saluran, ia mestilah "
"memelihara surih, dan oleh itu\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\operatorname{Tr}_{\\mathsf{Y}} (J(\\Phi))\n"
"& = \\sum_{a,b\\in\\Sigma} \\operatorname{Tr}\\bigl(\\Phi( \\vert a\\rangle\\langle b \\vert)\\bigr) \\, \\vert a\\rangle\\langle b \\vert\\\\\n"
"& = \\sum_{a,b\\in\\Sigma} \\operatorname{Tr}\\bigl(\\vert a\\rangle\\langle b \\vert\\bigr) \\, \\vert a\\rangle\\langle b \\vert\\\\\n"
"& = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\vert a\\rangle\\langle a \\vert\\\\\n"
"& = \\mathbb{I}_{\\mathsf{X}}.\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\operatorname{Tr}_{\\mathsf{Y}} (J(\\Phi))\n"
"& = \\sum_{a,b\\in\\Sigma} \\operatorname{Tr}\\bigl(\\Phi( \\vert a\\rangle\\langle b \\vert)\\bigr) \\, \\vert a\\rangle\\langle b \\vert\\\\\n"
"& = \\sum_{a,b\\in\\Sigma} \\operatorname{Tr}\\bigl(\\vert a\\rangle\\langle b \\vert\\bigr) \\, \\vert a\\rangle\\langle b \\vert\\\\\n"
"& = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\vert a\\rangle\\langle a \\vert\\\\\n"
"& = \\mathbb{I}_{\\mathsf{X}}.\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Choi to Kraus representations {#choi-to-kraus-representations}"
msgstr "Choi kepada perwakilan Kraus {#choi-to-kraus-representations}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The second implication, again referring to the statements in our list by their numbers, is 2 $\\Rightarrow$ 3.\n"
"To be clear, we're ignoring the other statements — and in particular we cannot make the assumption that $\\Phi$ is a channel.\n"
"All we have to work with is that $\\Phi$ is a linear mapping whose Choi representation satisfies $J(\\Phi) \\geq 0$ and\n"
"$\\operatorname{Tr}_{\\mathsf{Y}} (J(\\Phi)) = \\mathbb{I}_{\\mathsf{X}}.$\n"
msgstr ""
"Implikasi kedua, sekali lagi merujuk kepada pernyataan dalam senarai kita mengikut nombor mereka, ialah 2 $\\Rightarrow$ 3.\n"
"Untuk menjelaskan, kita mengabaikan pernyataan-pernyataan lain — dan khususnya kita tidak boleh membuat andaian bahawa $\\Phi$ adalah saluran.\n"
"Semua yang kita ada untuk digunakan ialah $\\Phi$ ialah pemetaan linear yang perwakilan Choi-nya memenuhi $J(\\Phi) \\geq 0$ dan\n"
"$\\operatorname{Tr}_{\\mathsf{Y}} (J(\\Phi)) = \\mathbb{I}_{\\mathsf{X}}.$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This, however, is all we need to conclude that $\\Phi$ has a Kraus "
"representation\n"
msgstr ""
"Ini, bagaimanapun, adalah semua yang kita perlukan untuk menyimpulkan bahawa"
" $\\Phi$ mempunyai perwakilan Kraus\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\Phi(\\rho) = \\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} A_k \\rho A_k^{\\dagger}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\Phi(\\rho) = \\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} A_k \\rho A_k^{\\dagger}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "for which the condition\n"
msgstr "di mana syarat\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} A_k^{\\dagger} A_k = \\mathbb{I}_{\\mathsf{X}}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} A_k^{\\dagger} A_k = \\mathbb{I}_{\\mathsf{X}}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "is satisfied.\n"
msgstr "dipenuhi.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We begin with the critically important assumption that $J(\\Phi)$ is "
"positive semidefinite, which means that it is possible to express it in the "
"form\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita mulakan dengan andaian yang sangat penting bahawa $J(\\Phi)$ adalah "
"separuh-tentu positif, yang bermakna ia mungkin untuk menyatakannya dalam "
"bentuk\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"J(\\Phi) = \\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} \\vert \\psi_k \\rangle \\langle \\psi_k \\vert\n"
"\\tag{1}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"J(\\Phi) = \\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} \\vert \\psi_k \\rangle \\langle \\psi_k \\vert\n"
"\\tag{1}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"for some way of choosing the vectors $\\vert\\psi_0\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_{N-1}\\rangle.$\n"
"In general there will be multiple ways to do this — and in fact this directly mirrors the freedom one has in choosing a Kraus representation for $\\Phi.$\n"
msgstr ""
"bagi sesetengah cara memilih vektor-vektor $\\vert\\psi_0\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_{N-1}\\rangle.$\n"
"Secara umum akan ada pelbagai cara untuk melakukan ini — dan sebenarnya ini mencerminkan secara langsung kebebasan yang ada dalam memilih perwakilan Kraus bagi $\\Phi.$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"One way to obtain such an expression is to first use the spectral theorem to"
" write\n"
msgstr ""
"Satu cara untuk mendapatkan ungkapan sedemikian ialah dengan terlebih dahulu"
" menggunakan teorem spektrum untuk menulis\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"J(\\Phi) = \\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} \\lambda_k \\vert \\gamma_k \\rangle \\langle \\gamma_k \\vert,\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"J(\\Phi) = \\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} \\lambda_k \\vert \\gamma_k \\rangle \\langle \\gamma_k \\vert,\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"in which $\\lambda_0,\\ldots,\\lambda_{N-1}$ are the eigenvalues of "
"$J(\\Phi)$ (which are necessarily nonnegative real numbers because "
"$J(\\Phi)$ is positive semidefinite) and "
"$\\vert\\gamma_0\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\gamma_{N-1}\\rangle$ are unit "
"eigenvectors corresponding to the eigenvalues "
"$\\lambda_0,\\ldots,\\lambda_{N-1}.$\n"
msgstr ""
"di mana $\\lambda_0,\\ldots,\\lambda_{N-1}$ adalah nilai-nilai eigen "
"$J(\\Phi)$ (yang semestinya nombor nyata bukan negatif kerana $J(\\Phi)$ "
"adalah separuh-tentu positif) dan "
"$\\vert\\gamma_0\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\gamma_{N-1}\\rangle$ adalah vektor-"
"vektor eigen unit yang sepadan dengan nilai-nilai eigen "
"$\\lambda_0,\\ldots,\\lambda_{N-1}.$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Note that, while there's no freedom in choosing the eigenvalues (except for how they're ordered), there is freedom in the choice of the eigenvectors, particularly when there are eigenvalues with multiplicity larger than one.\n"
"So, this is not a unique expression of $J(\\Phi)$ — we're just assuming we have one such expression.\n"
"Regardless, because the eigenvalues are nonnegative real numbers, they have nonnegative square roots, and so we can select\n"
msgstr ""
"Perlu diingat bahawa, walaupun tidak ada kebebasan dalam memilih nilai eigen (kecuali bagaimana ia tersusun), terdapat kebebasan dalam pemilihan vektor-vektor eigen, terutamanya apabila terdapat nilai-nilai eigen dengan kepelbagaian lebih daripada satu.\n"
"Jadi, ini bukan ungkapan unik $J(\\Phi)$ — kita hanya menganggap kita mempunyai satu ungkapan sedemikian.\n"
"Walau bagaimanapun, kerana nilai-nilai eigen adalah nombor nyata bukan negatif, ia mempunyai punca kuasa dua bukan negatif, dan jadi kita boleh memilih\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert\\psi_k\\rangle = \\sqrt{\\lambda_k} \\vert \\gamma_k\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert\\psi_k\\rangle = \\sqrt{\\lambda_k} \\vert \\gamma_k\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "for each $k = 0,\\ldots,N-1$ to obtain an expression of the form $(1).$\n"
msgstr ""
"bagi setiap $k = 0,\\ldots,N-1$ untuk mendapatkan ungkapan berbentuk "
"$(1).$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"It is, however, not essential that the expression $(1)$ comes from a spectral decomposition in this way, and in particular the vectors $\\vert\\psi_0\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_{N-1}\\rangle$ need not be orthogonal in general.\n"
"It is noteworthy, though, that we can choose these vectors to be orthogonal if we wish — and moreover we never need $N$ to be larger than $nm$\n"
"(recalling that $n$ and $m$ denote the numbers of classical states of $\\mathsf{X}$ and $\\mathsf{Y},$ respectively).\n"
msgstr ""
"Namun, tidak semestinya ungkapan $(1)$ berasal dari penguraian spektrum dengan cara ini, dan khususnya vektor-vektor $\\vert\\psi_0\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_{N-1}\\rangle$ tidak perlu ortogon secara umum.\n"
"Adalah penting untuk diperhatikan, bagaimanapun, bahawa kita boleh memilih vektor-vektor ini menjadi ortogon jika kita mahu — dan lebih-lebih lagi kita tidak perlu $N$ lebih besar daripada $nm$\n"
"(dengan mengingat bahawa $n$ dan $m$ masing-masing menandakan bilangan keadaan klasik $\\mathsf{X}$ dan $\\mathsf{Y}$).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Next, each of the vectors "
"$\\vert\\psi_0\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_{N-1}\\rangle$ can be further "
"decomposed as\n"
msgstr ""
"Seterusnya, setiap vektor "
"$\\vert\\psi_0\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_{N-1}\\rangle$ boleh diuraikan "
"selanjutnya sebagai\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert\\psi_k\\rangle = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\vert a\\rangle \\otimes \\vert \\phi_{k,a}\\rangle,\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert\\psi_k\\rangle = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\vert a\\rangle \\otimes \\vert \\phi_{k,a}\\rangle,\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"where the vectors $\\{ \\vert \\phi_{k,a}\\rangle \\}$ have entries "
"corresponding to the classical states of $\\mathsf{Y}$ and can be explicitly"
" determined by the equation\n"
msgstr ""
"di mana vektor-vektor $\\{ \\vert \\phi_{k,a}\\rangle \\}$ mempunyai entri "
"yang sepadan dengan keadaan klasik $\\mathsf{Y}$ dan boleh ditentukan secara"
" eksplisit oleh persamaan\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert \\phi_{k,a}\\rangle = \\bigl( \\langle a \\vert \\otimes \\mathbb{I}_{\\mathsf{Y}}\\bigr) \\vert \\psi_k\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert \\phi_{k,a}\\rangle = \\bigl( \\langle a \\vert \\otimes \\mathbb{I}_{\\mathsf{Y}}\\bigr) \\vert \\psi_k\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"for each $a\\in\\Sigma$ and $k=0,\\ldots,N-1.$\n"
"Although $\\vert\\psi_0\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_{N-1}\\rangle$ are not necessarily unit vectors, this is the same process we would use to analyze what would happen if a standard basis measurement was performed on the system $\\mathsf{X}$ given a quantum state vector of the pair $(\\mathsf{X},\\mathsf{Y}).$\n"
msgstr ""
"bagi setiap $a\\in\\Sigma$ dan $k=0,\\ldots,N-1.$\n"
"Walaupun $\\vert\\psi_0\\rangle,\\ldots,\\vert\\psi_{N-1}\\rangle$ tidak semestinya vektor-vektor unit, ini adalah proses yang sama yang kita gunakan untuk menganalisis apa yang akan berlaku jika pengukuran asas piawai dilakukan pada sistem $\\mathsf{X}$ berdasarkan vektor keadaan kuantum pasangan $(\\mathsf{X},\\mathsf{Y}).$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"And now we come to the trick that makes this part of the proof work.\n"
"We define our Kraus matrices $A_0,\\ldots,A_{N-1}$ according to the following equation.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dan kini kita sampai kepada trik yang menjadikan bahagian bukti ini berfungsi.\n"
"Kita mentakrifkan matriks Kraus kita $A_0,\\ldots,A_{N-1}$ mengikut persamaan berikut.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"A_k = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\vert \\phi_{k,a}\\rangle\\langle a \\vert\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"A_k = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\vert \\phi_{k,a}\\rangle\\langle a \\vert\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We can think about this formula purely symbolically: $\\vert a\\rangle$ effectively gets flipped around to form $\\langle a\\vert$ and moved to right-hand side, forming a matrix.\n"
"For the purposes of verifying the proof, the formula is all we need.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita boleh memikirkan formula ini secara simbolik semata-mata: $\\vert a\\rangle$ secara berkesan dibalikkan untuk membentuk $\\langle a\\vert$ dan dipindahkan ke sisi kanan, membentuk matriks.\n"
"Untuk tujuan mengesahkan bukti, formula itu adalah semua yang kita perlukan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"There is, however, a simple and intuitive relationship between the vector $\\vert\\psi_k\\rangle$ and the matrix $A_k,$ which is that by *vectorizing* $A_k$ we get $\\vert\\psi_k\\rangle.$\n"
"What it means to vectorize $A_k$ is that we stack the columns on top of one another (with the leftmost column on top proceeding to the rightmost on the bottom), in order to form a vector.\n"
"For instance, if $\\mathsf{X}$ and $\\mathsf{Y}$ are both qubits, and for some choice of $k$ we have\n"
msgstr ""
"Walau bagaimanapun, terdapat hubungan yang mudah dan intuitif antara vektor $\\vert\\psi_k\\rangle$ dan matriks $A_k,$ iaitu dengan *memvektorkan* $A_k$ kita mendapat $\\vert\\psi_k\\rangle.$\n"
"Maksud memvektorkan $A_k$ ialah kita menumpuk lajur-lajur satu di atas yang lain (dengan lajur paling kiri di atas hingga ke paling kanan di bawah), untuk membentuk vektor.\n"
"Sebagai contoh, jika $\\mathsf{X}$ dan $\\mathsf{Y}$ keduanya adalah qubit, dan bagi sesetengah pilihan $k$ kita mempunyai\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\vert\\psi_k\\rangle & = \\alpha_{00} \\vert 0\\rangle \\otimes \\vert 0\\rangle +\n"
"\\alpha_{01} \\vert 0\\rangle \\otimes \\vert 1\\rangle +\n"
"\\alpha_{10} \\vert 1\\rangle \\otimes \\vert 0\\rangle +\n"
"\\alpha_{11} \\vert 1\\rangle \\otimes \\vert 1\\rangle\\\\[2mm]\n"
"& = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\alpha_{00} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\alpha_{01} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\alpha_{10} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\alpha_{11}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix},\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\vert\\psi_k\\rangle & = \\alpha_{00} \\vert 0\\rangle \\otimes \\vert 0\\rangle +\n"
"\\alpha_{01} \\vert 0\\rangle \\otimes \\vert 1\\rangle +\n"
"\\alpha_{10} \\vert 1\\rangle \\otimes \\vert 0\\rangle +\n"
"\\alpha_{11} \\vert 1\\rangle \\otimes \\vert 1\\rangle\\\\[2mm]\n"
"& = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\alpha_{00} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\alpha_{01} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\alpha_{10} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\alpha_{11}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix},\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "then\n"
msgstr "maka\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"A_k & = \\alpha_{00} \\vert 0\\rangle\\langle 0\\vert +\n"
"\\alpha_{01} \\vert 1\\rangle\\langle 0\\vert +\n"
"\\alpha_{10} \\vert 0\\rangle\\langle 1\\vert +\n"
"\\alpha_{11} \\vert 1\\rangle\\langle 1\\vert\\\\[2mm]\n"
"& = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\alpha_{00} & \\alpha_{10}\\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\alpha_{01} & \\alpha_{11}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}.\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"A_k & = \\alpha_{00} \\vert 0\\rangle\\langle 0\\vert +\n"
"\\alpha_{01} \\vert 1\\rangle\\langle 0\\vert +\n"
"\\alpha_{10} \\vert 0\\rangle\\langle 1\\vert +\n"
"\\alpha_{11} \\vert 1\\rangle\\langle 1\\vert\\\\[2mm]\n"
"& = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"\\alpha_{00} & \\alpha_{10}\\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\alpha_{01} & \\alpha_{11}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}.\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(Beware: sometimes the vectorization of a matrix is defined in a slightly "
"different way, which is that the *rows* of the matrix are transposed and "
"stacked on top of one another to form a column vector.)\n"
msgstr ""
"(Berhati-hati: kadang-kadang pemvektoran matriks ditakrifkan dengan cara "
"yang sedikit berbeza, iaitu *baris-baris* matriks dipindah arah dan ditumpuk"
" satu di atas yang lain untuk membentuk vektor lajur.)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"First we'll verify that this choice of Kraus matrices correctly describes the mapping $\\Phi,$ after which we'll verify the other required condition.\n"
"To keep things straight, let's define a new mapping $\\Psi$ as follows.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pertama kita akan mengesahkan bahawa pilihan matriks Kraus ini menggambarkan pemetaan $\\Phi$ dengan betul, selepas itu kita akan mengesahkan syarat lain yang diperlukan.\n"
"Untuk memastikan kejelasan, mari kita takrifkan pemetaan baru $\\Psi$ seperti berikut.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\Psi(\\rho) = \\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} A_k \\rho A_k^{\\dagger}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\Psi(\\rho) = \\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} A_k \\rho A_k^{\\dagger}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Thus, our goal is to verify that $\\Psi = \\Phi.$\n"
msgstr "Jadi, matlamat kita adalah untuk mengesahkan bahawa $\\Psi = \\Phi.$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The way we can do this is to compare the Choi representations of these mappings.\n"
"Choi representations are faithful, so we have $\\Psi = \\Phi$ if and only if $J(\\Phi) = J(\\Psi).$\n"
"At this point we can simply compute $J(\\Psi)$ using the expressions\n"
msgstr ""
"Cara kita boleh melakukan ini ialah dengan membandingkan perwakilan Choi pemetaan-pemetaan ini.\n"
"Perwakilan Choi adalah setia, jadi kita mempunyai $\\Psi = \\Phi$ jika dan hanya jika $J(\\Phi) = J(\\Psi).$\n"
"Pada ketika ini kita boleh terus mengira $J(\\Psi)$ menggunakan ungkapan-ungkapan\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert\\psi_k\\rangle = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\vert a\\rangle \\otimes \\vert \\phi_{k,a}\\rangle\n"
"\\quad\\text{and}\\quad\n"
"A_k = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\vert \\phi_{k,a}\\rangle\\langle a \\vert\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert\\psi_k\\rangle = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\vert a\\rangle \\otimes \\vert \\phi_{k,a}\\rangle\n"
"\\quad\\text{dan}\\quad\n"
"A_k = \\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\vert \\phi_{k,a}\\rangle\\langle a \\vert\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "together with the bilinearity of tensor products to simplify.\n"
msgstr ""
"bersama-sama dengan kelinearan dwi hasil darab tensor untuk memudahkan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"J(\\Psi) & = \\sum_{a,b\\in\\Sigma}  \\vert a\\rangle \\langle b \\vert \\otimes \\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} A_k \\vert a\\rangle \\langle b \\vert A_k^{\\dagger}\\\\[2mm]\n"
"& = \\sum_{a,b\\in\\Sigma}  \\vert a\\rangle \\langle b \\vert \\otimes \\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1}  \\vert \\phi_{k,a} \\rangle \\langle \\phi_{k,b} \\vert \\\\[2mm]\n"
"& = \\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} \\biggl(\\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\vert a\\rangle \\otimes \\vert \\phi_{k,a} \\rangle\\biggr)\n"
"\\biggl(\\sum_{b\\in\\Sigma} \\langle b\\vert \\otimes \\langle \\phi_{k,b} \\vert\\biggr)\\\\[2mm]\n"
"& = \\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} \\vert \\psi_k \\rangle \\langle \\psi_k \\vert \\\\[2mm]\n"
"& = J(\\Phi)\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"J(\\Psi) & = \\sum_{a,b\\in\\Sigma}  \\vert a\\rangle \\langle b \\vert \\otimes \\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} A_k \\vert a\\rangle \\langle b \\vert A_k^{\\dagger}\\\\[2mm]\n"
"& = \\sum_{a,b\\in\\Sigma}  \\vert a\\rangle \\langle b \\vert \\otimes \\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1}  \\vert \\phi_{k,a} \\rangle \\langle \\phi_{k,b} \\vert \\\\[2mm]\n"
"& = \\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} \\biggl(\\sum_{a\\in\\Sigma} \\vert a\\rangle \\otimes \\vert \\phi_{k,a} \\rangle\\biggr)\n"
"\\biggl(\\sum_{b\\in\\Sigma} \\langle b\\vert \\otimes \\langle \\phi_{k,b} \\vert\\biggr)\\\\[2mm]\n"
"& = \\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} \\vert \\psi_k \\rangle \\langle \\psi_k \\vert \\\\[2mm]\n"
"& = J(\\Phi)\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "So, our Kraus matrices correctly describe $\\Phi.$\n"
msgstr "Jadi, matriks Kraus kita menggambarkan $\\Phi$ dengan betul.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"It remains to check the required condition on $A_0,\\ldots,A_{N-1},$ which turns out to be equivalent to the assumption $\\operatorname{Tr}_{\\mathsf{Y}}(J(\\Phi)) = \\mathbb{I}_{\\mathsf{X}}$ (which we haven't used yet).\n"
"What we'll show is this relationship:\n"
msgstr ""
"Tinggal lagi untuk memeriksa syarat yang diperlukan pada $A_0,\\ldots,A_{N-1},$ yang ternyata bersamaan dengan andaian $\\operatorname{Tr}_{\\mathsf{Y}}(J(\\Phi)) = \\mathbb{I}_{\\mathsf{X}}$ (yang belum kita gunakan lagi).\n"
"Apa yang akan kita tunjukkan ialah hubungan ini:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\Biggl( \\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} A_k^{\\dagger} A_k \\Biggr)^{T} = \\operatorname{Tr}_{\\mathsf{Y}}(J(\\Phi))\n"
"\\tag{2}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\Biggl( \\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} A_k^{\\dagger} A_k \\Biggr)^{T} = \\operatorname{Tr}_{\\mathsf{Y}}(J(\\Phi))\n"
"\\tag{2}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(in which we're referring the *matrix transpose* on the left-hand side).\n"
msgstr "(di mana kita merujuk kepada *pindah arah matriks* pada sisi kiri).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Starting on the left, we can first observe that\n"
msgstr "Bermula dari kiri, kita boleh terlebih dahulu memerhati bahawa\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\Biggl(\\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} A_k^{\\dagger} A_k\\Biggr)^T\n"
"& = \\Biggl(\\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} \\sum_{a,b\\in\\Sigma} \\vert b \\rangle \\langle \\phi_{k,b} \\vert \\phi_{k,a} \\rangle \\langle a \\vert\\Biggr)^T\\\\\n"
"& = \\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} \\sum_{a,b\\in\\Sigma} \\langle \\phi_{k,b} \\vert \\phi_{k,a} \\rangle \\vert a \\rangle  \\langle b \\vert.\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\Biggl(\\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} A_k^{\\dagger} A_k\\Biggr)^T\n"
"& = \\Biggl(\\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} \\sum_{a,b\\in\\Sigma} \\vert b \\rangle \\langle \\phi_{k,b} \\vert \\phi_{k,a} \\rangle \\langle a \\vert\\Biggr)^T\\\\\n"
"& = \\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} \\sum_{a,b\\in\\Sigma} \\langle \\phi_{k,b} \\vert \\phi_{k,a} \\rangle \\vert a \\rangle  \\langle b \\vert.\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The last equality follows from the fact that the transpose is linear and "
"maps $\\vert b\\rangle\\langle a \\vert$ to $\\vert a\\rangle\\langle b "
"\\vert.$\n"
msgstr ""
"Persamaan terakhir mengikut fakta bahawa pindah arah adalah linear dan "
"memetakan $\\vert b\\rangle\\langle a \\vert$ kepada $\\vert "
"a\\rangle\\langle b \\vert.$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Moving to the right-hand side of our equation, we have\n"
msgstr "Beralih ke sisi kanan persamaan kita, kita mempunyai\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"J(\\Phi) = \\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} \\vert \\psi_k\\rangle\\langle\\psi_k \\vert\n"
"= \\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} \\sum_{a,b\\in\\Sigma} \\vert a\\rangle \\langle b \\vert \\otimes \\vert\\phi_{k,a}\\rangle\\langle \\phi_{k,b} \\vert\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"J(\\Phi) = \\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} \\vert \\psi_k\\rangle\\langle\\psi_k \\vert\n"
"= \\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} \\sum_{a,b\\in\\Sigma} \\vert a\\rangle \\langle b \\vert \\otimes \\vert\\phi_{k,a}\\rangle\\langle \\phi_{k,b} \\vert\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "and therefore\n"
msgstr "dan oleh itu\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\operatorname{Tr}_{\\mathsf{Y}}(J(\\Phi))\n"
"& = \\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} \\sum_{a,b\\in\\Sigma} \\operatorname{Tr}\\bigl(\\vert\\phi_{k,a}\\rangle\\langle \\phi_{k,b} \\vert \\bigr)\\,\n"
"\\vert a\\rangle \\langle b \\vert\\\\\n"
"& = \\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} \\sum_{a,b\\in\\Sigma} \\langle \\phi_{k,b} \\vert \\phi_{k,a} \\rangle \\vert a \\rangle  \\langle b \\vert.\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\operatorname{Tr}_{\\mathsf{Y}}(J(\\Phi))\n"
"& = \\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} \\sum_{a,b\\in\\Sigma} \\operatorname{Tr}\\bigl(\\vert\\phi_{k,a}\\rangle\\langle \\phi_{k,b} \\vert \\bigr)\\,\n"
"\\vert a\\rangle \\langle b \\vert\\\\\n"
"& = \\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} \\sum_{a,b\\in\\Sigma} \\langle \\phi_{k,b} \\vert \\phi_{k,a} \\rangle \\vert a \\rangle  \\langle b \\vert.\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We've obtained the same result, and therefore the equation $(2)$ has been verified.\n"
"It follows, by the assumption $\\operatorname{Tr}_{\\mathsf{Y}} (J(\\Phi)) = \\mathbb{I}_{\\mathsf{X}},$ that\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita telah mendapat hasil yang sama, dan oleh itu persamaan $(2)$ telah disahkan.\n"
"Ia mengikut, berdasarkan andaian $\\operatorname{Tr}_{\\mathsf{Y}} (J(\\Phi)) = \\mathbb{I}_{\\mathsf{X}},$ bahawa\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\Biggl(\\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} A_k^{\\dagger} A_k\\Biggr)^T = \\mathbb{I}_{\\mathsf{X}}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\Biggl(\\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} A_k^{\\dagger} A_k\\Biggr)^T = \\mathbb{I}_{\\mathsf{X}}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"and therefore, because the identity matrix is its own transpose, the "
"required condition is true.\n"
msgstr ""
"dan oleh itu, kerana matriks identiti adalah pindah arahnya sendiri, syarat "
"yang diperlukan adalah benar.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Kraus to Stinespring representations {#kraus-to-stinespring-representations}"
msgstr ""
"Kraus kepada perwakilan Stinespring {#kraus-to-stinespring-representations}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Now suppose that we have a Kraus representation of a mapping\n"
msgstr "Sekarang andaikan kita mempunyai perwakilan Kraus bagi suatu pemetaan\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "for which\n"
msgstr "yang memenuhi\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} A_k^{\\dagger} A_k = \\mathbb{I}_{\\mathsf{X}}.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} A_k^{\\dagger} A_k = \\mathbb{I}_{\\mathsf{X}}.\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Our goal is to find a Stinespring representation for $\\Phi.$\n"
msgstr "Matlamat kita ialah untuk mencari perwakilan Stinespring bagi $\\Phi.$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"What we'd like to do first is to choose the garbage system $\\mathsf{G}$ so that its classical state set is $\\{0,\\ldots,N-1\\}.$\n"
"For $(\\mathsf{W},\\mathsf{X})$ and $(\\mathsf{G},\\mathsf{Y})$ to have the same size, however, it must be that\n"
"$n$ divides $m N,$ allowing us to take $\\mathsf{W}$ to have classical states $\\{0,\\ldots,d-1\\}$ for $d = mN/n.$\n"
msgstr ""
"Perkara pertama yang ingin kita lakukan ialah memilih sistem sampah $\\mathsf{G}$ supaya set keadaan klasiknya ialah $\\{0,\\ldots,N-1\\}.$\n"
"Namun begitu, untuk $(\\mathsf{W},\\mathsf{X})$ dan $(\\mathsf{G},\\mathsf{Y})$ mempunyai saiz yang sama, syaratnya ialah\n"
"$n$ membahagi $m N,$ yang membolehkan kita mengambil $\\mathsf{W}$ mempunyai keadaan klasik $\\{0,\\ldots,d-1\\}$ untuk $d = mN/n.$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For an arbitrary choice of $n,$ $m,$ and $N,$ it may not be the case that $mN/n$ is an integer, so we're not actually free to choose $\\mathsf{G}$ so that it's classical state set is $\\{0,\\ldots,N-1\\}.$\n"
"But we can always increase $N$ arbitrarily in the Kraus representation by choosing $A_k = 0$ for however many additional values of $k$ that we wish.\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk pilihan $n,$ $m,$ dan $N$ yang sewenang-wenangnya, mungkin sahaja $mN/n$ bukan integer, jadi kita sebenarnya tidak bebas memilih $\\mathsf{G}$ supaya set keadaan klasiknya ialah $\\{0,\\ldots,N-1\\}.$\n"
"Tetapi kita sentiasa boleh meningkatkan $N$ secara sewenang-wenangnya dalam perwakilan Kraus dengan memilih $A_k = 0$ untuk seberapa banyak nilai $k$ tambahan yang kita mahu.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"So, if we tacitly assume that $mN/n$ is an integer, which is equivalent to $N$ being a multiple of $n/\\operatorname{gcd}(n,m),$ then we're free to take $\\mathsf{G}$ so that its classical state set is $\\{0,\\ldots,N-1\\}.$\n"
"In particular, if it is the case that $N = nm,$ then we may take $\\mathsf{W}$ to have $m^2$ classical states.\n"
msgstr ""
"Jadi, jika kita secara diam-diam andaikan bahawa $mN/n$ ialah integer, yang bersamaan dengan $N$ menjadi gandaan $n/\\operatorname{gcd}(n,m),$ maka kita bebas mengambil $\\mathsf{G}$ supaya set keadaan klasiknya ialah $\\{0,\\ldots,N-1\\}.$\n"
"Khususnya, jika $N = nm,$ maka kita boleh ambil $\\mathsf{W}$ untuk mempunyai $m^2$ keadaan klasik.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"It remains to choose $U,$ and we'll do this by matching the following "
"pattern.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tinggal lagi untuk memilih $U,$ dan kita akan lakukan ini dengan memadankan "
"corak berikut.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"U =\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"A_{0} & \\fbox{?} & \\cdots & \\fbox{?} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"A_{1} & \\fbox{?} & \\cdots & \\fbox{?} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\vdots & \\vdots & \\ddots & \\vdots\\\\[1mm]\n"
"A_{N-1} & \\fbox{?} & \\cdots & \\fbox{?}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"U =\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"A_{0} & \\fbox{?} & \\cdots & \\fbox{?} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"A_{1} & \\fbox{?} & \\cdots & \\fbox{?} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\vdots & \\vdots & \\ddots & \\vdots\\\\[1mm]\n"
"A_{N-1} & \\fbox{?} & \\cdots & \\fbox{?}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To be clear, this pattern is meant to suggest a block matrix, where each block (including $A_{0},\\ldots,A_{N-1}$ as well as the blocks marked with a question mark) has $m$ rows and $n$ columns.\n"
"There are $N$ rows of blocks, which means that there are $d = mN/n$ columns of blocks.\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk jelasnya, corak ini dimaksudkan untuk mencadangkan matriks blok, di mana setiap blok (termasuk $A_{0},\\ldots,A_{N-1}$ serta blok yang ditandai dengan tanda soal) mempunyai $m$ baris dan $n$ lajur.\n"
"Terdapat $N$ baris blok, yang bermakna terdapat $d = mN/n$ lajur blok.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Expressed in more formulaic terms, we will define $U$ as\n"
msgstr "Dalam istilah yang lebih formulaik, kita akan takrifkan $U$ sebagai\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"U & = \\sum_{k=0}^{N-1} \\sum_{j=0}^{d-1} \\vert k \\rangle \\langle j \\vert \\otimes M_{k,j} \\\\[4mm]\n"
"& = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"M_{0,0} & M_{0,1} & \\cdots & M_{0,d-1} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"M_{1,0} & M_{1,1} & \\cdots & M_{1,d-1} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\vdots & \\vdots & \\ddots & \\vdots\\\\[1mm]\n"
"M_{N-1,0} & M_{N-1,1} & \\cdots & M_{N-1,d-1}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"U & = \\sum_{k=0}^{N-1} \\sum_{j=0}^{d-1} \\vert k \\rangle \\langle j \\vert \\otimes M_{k,j} \\\\[4mm]\n"
"& = \\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"M_{0,0} & M_{0,1} & \\cdots & M_{0,d-1} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"M_{1,0} & M_{1,1} & \\cdots & M_{1,d-1} \\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\vdots & \\vdots & \\ddots & \\vdots\\\\[1mm]\n"
"M_{N-1,0} & M_{N-1,1} & \\cdots & M_{N-1,d-1}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"where each matrix $M_{k,j}$ has $m$ rows and $n$ columns, and in particular "
"we shall take $M_{k,0} = A_k$ for $k = 0,\\ldots,N-1.$\n"
msgstr ""
"di mana setiap matriks $M_{k,j}$ mempunyai $m$ baris dan $n$ lajur, dan "
"khususnya kita akan ambil $M_{k,0} = A_k$ untuk $k = 0,\\ldots,N-1.$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This must be a unitary matrix, and the blocks labeled with a question mark, "
"or equivalently $M_{k,j}$ for $j>0,$ must be selected with this in mind — "
"but aside from allowing $U$ to be unitary, the blocks labeled with a "
"question mark won't have any relevance to the proof.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ini mesti menjadi matriks unitari, dan blok-blok yang dilabel dengan tanda "
"soal, atau secara setara $M_{k,j}$ untuk $j>0,$ mesti dipilih dengan "
"mengambil kira ini — tetapi selain membenarkan $U$ menjadi unitari, blok-"
"blok yang dilabel dengan tanda soal tidak akan mempunyai kaitan dengan bukti"
" ini.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Let's momentarily disregard the concern that $U$ is unitary and focus on the"
" expression\n"
msgstr ""
"Mari kita sebentar abaikan kebimbangan bahawa $U$ unitari dan tumpukan pada "
"ungkapan\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\operatorname{Tr}_{\\mathsf{G}} \\bigl( U (\\vert 0\\rangle \\langle 0 \\vert_{\\mathsf{W}} \\otimes \\rho)U^{\\dagger}\\bigr)\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\operatorname{Tr}_{\\mathsf{G}} \\bigl( U (\\vert 0\\rangle \\langle 0 \\vert_{\\mathsf{W}} \\otimes \\rho)U^{\\dagger}\\bigr)\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"that describes the output state of $\\mathsf{Y}$ given the input state $\\rho$ of $\\mathsf{X}$ for our Stinespring representation.\n"
"We can alternatively write\n"
msgstr ""
"yang menerangkan keadaan output $\\mathsf{Y}$ diberi keadaan input $\\rho$ bagi $\\mathsf{X}$ untuk perwakilan Stinespring kita.\n"
"Kita boleh tulis secara alternatif\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"U(\\vert 0\\rangle\\langle 0 \\vert \\otimes \\rho)U^{\\dagger}\n"
"= U(\\vert 0\\rangle\\otimes\\mathbb{I}_{\\mathsf{X}}) \\rho (\\langle 0\\vert \\otimes \\mathbb{I}_{\\mathsf{X}}) U^{\\dagger},\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"U(\\vert 0\\rangle\\langle 0 \\vert \\otimes \\rho)U^{\\dagger}\n"
"= U(\\vert 0\\rangle\\otimes\\mathbb{I}_{\\mathsf{X}}) \\rho (\\langle 0\\vert \\otimes \\mathbb{I}_{\\mathsf{X}}) U^{\\dagger},\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "and we see from our choice of $U$ that\n"
msgstr "dan kita lihat daripada pilihan $U$ kita bahawa\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"U(\\vert 0\\rangle\\otimes\\mathbb{I}_{\\mathsf{X}}) =\n"
"\\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} \\vert k\\rangle \\otimes A_k.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"U(\\vert 0\\rangle\\otimes\\mathbb{I}_{\\mathsf{X}}) =\n"
"\\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} \\vert k\\rangle \\otimes A_k.\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "We therefore find that\n"
msgstr "Oleh itu kita dapati bahawa\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"U(\\vert 0\\rangle\\langle 0 \\vert \\otimes \\rho)U^{\\dagger}\n"
"= \\sum_{j,k = 0}^{N-1} \\vert k\\rangle\\langle j\\vert \\otimes A_k \\rho A_j^{\\dagger},\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"U(\\vert 0\\rangle\\langle 0 \\vert \\otimes \\rho)U^{\\dagger}\n"
"= \\sum_{j,k = 0}^{N-1} \\vert k\\rangle\\langle j\\vert \\otimes A_k \\rho A_j^{\\dagger},\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "and so\n"
msgstr "dan jadi\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\operatorname{Tr}_{\\mathsf{G}} \\bigl( U (\\vert 0\\rangle \\langle 0 \\vert_{\\mathsf{W}} \\otimes \\rho) U^{\\dagger}\\bigr)\n"
"& = \\sum_{j,k = 0}^{N-1} \\operatorname{Tr}\\bigl(\\vert k\\rangle\\langle j\\vert\\bigr) \\, A_k \\rho A_j^{\\dagger} \\\\\n"
"& = \\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} A_k \\rho A_k^{\\dagger} \\\\\n"
"& = \\Phi(\\rho).\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\operatorname{Tr}_{\\mathsf{G}} \\bigl( U (\\vert 0\\rangle \\langle 0 \\vert_{\\mathsf{W}} \\otimes \\rho) U^{\\dagger}\\bigr)\n"
"& = \\sum_{j,k = 0}^{N-1} \\operatorname{Tr}\\bigl(\\vert k\\rangle\\langle j\\vert\\bigr) \\, A_k \\rho A_j^{\\dagger} \\\\\n"
"& = \\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} A_k \\rho A_k^{\\dagger} \\\\\n"
"& = \\Phi(\\rho).\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We therefore have a correct representation for the mapping $\\Phi,$ and it "
"remains to verify that we can choose $U$ to be unitary.\n"
msgstr ""
"Oleh itu kita mempunyai perwakilan yang betul untuk pemetaan $\\Phi,$ dan "
"tinggal lagi untuk mengesahkan bahawa kita boleh memilih $U$ menjadi "
"unitari.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Consider the first $n$ columns of $U$ when it's selected according to the pattern above.\n"
"Taking these columns alone, we have a block matrix\n"
msgstr ""
"Pertimbangkan $n$ lajur pertama $U$ apabila ia dipilih mengikut corak di atas.\n"
"Mengambil lajur-lajur ini sahaja, kita mempunyai matriks blok\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"A_0\\\\[1mm]\n"
"A_1\\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\vdots\\\\[1mm]\n"
"A_{N-1}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"A_0\\\\[1mm]\n"
"A_1\\\\[1mm]\n"
"\\vdots\\\\[1mm]\n"
"A_{N-1}\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}.\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"There are $n$ columns, one for each classical state of $\\mathsf{X},$ and as vectors let us name the columns as $\\vert \\gamma_a \\rangle$ for each $a\\in\\Sigma.$\n"
"Here's a formula for these vectors that can be matched to the block matrix representation above.\n"
msgstr ""
"Terdapat $n$ lajur, satu untuk setiap keadaan klasik $\\mathsf{X},$ dan sebagai vektor kita namakan lajur-lajur ini sebagai $\\vert \\gamma_a \\rangle$ untuk setiap $a\\in\\Sigma.$\n"
"Berikut adalah formula bagi vektor-vektor ini yang boleh dipadankan dengan perwakilan matriks blok di atas.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert \\gamma_a\\rangle = \\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} \\vert k\\rangle \\otimes A_k \\vert a \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert \\gamma_a\\rangle = \\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} \\vert k\\rangle \\otimes A_k \\vert a \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now let's compute the inner product between any two of these vectors, "
"meaning the ones corresponding to any choice of $a,b\\in\\Sigma.$\n"
msgstr ""
"Sekarang mari kita kira hasil darab dalam antara mana-mana dua vektor ini, "
"bermakna yang berpadanan dengan sebarang pilihan $a,b\\in\\Sigma.$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\langle \\gamma_a \\vert \\gamma_b \\rangle =\n"
"\\sum_{j,k = 0}^{N-1} \\langle k \\vert j \\rangle \\, \\langle a \\vert A_k^{\\dagger} A_j \\vert b\\rangle =\n"
"\\langle a \\vert \\Biggl( \\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} A_k^{\\dagger} A_k \\Biggr) \\vert b\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\langle \\gamma_a \\vert \\gamma_b \\rangle =\n"
"\\sum_{j,k = 0}^{N-1} \\langle k \\vert j \\rangle \\, \\langle a \\vert A_k^{\\dagger} A_j \\vert b\\rangle =\n"
"\\langle a \\vert \\Biggl( \\sum_{k = 0}^{N-1} A_k^{\\dagger} A_k \\Biggr) \\vert b\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "By the assumption\n"
msgstr "Dengan andaian\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\sum_{k = 0}^{m-1} A_k^{\\dagger} A_k = \\mathbb{I}_{\\mathsf{X}}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\sum_{k = 0}^{m-1} A_k^{\\dagger} A_k = \\mathbb{I}_{\\mathsf{X}}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"we conclude that the $n$ column vectors "
"$\\{\\vert\\gamma_a\\rangle\\,:\\,a\\in\\Sigma\\}$ form an orthonormal "
"set:\n"
msgstr ""
"kita simpulkan bahawa $n$ vektor lajur "
"$\\{\\vert\\gamma_a\\rangle\\,:\\,a\\in\\Sigma\\}$ membentuk set "
"ortonormal:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\langle \\gamma_a \\vert \\gamma_b \\rangle = \\begin{cases}\n"
"1 & a = b\\\\\n"
"0 & a\\neq b\n"
"\\end{cases}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\langle \\gamma_a \\vert \\gamma_b \\rangle = \\begin{cases}\n"
"1 & a = b\\\\\n"
"0 & a\\neq b\n"
"\\end{cases}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "for all $a,b\\in\\Sigma.$\n"
msgstr "untuk semua $a,b\\in\\Sigma.$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This implies that it is possible to fill out the remaining columns of $U$ so that it becomes a unitary matrix.\n"
"In particular, the Gram-Schmidt orthogonalization process can be used to select the remaining columns.\n"
"Something similar was done in the *Quantum circuits* lesson of \"Basics of quantum information\" in the context of the state discrimination problem.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ini bermakna adalah mungkin untuk melengkapkan lajur-lajur $U$ yang tinggal supaya ia menjadi matriks unitari.\n"
"Khususnya, proses orthogonalisasi Gram-Schmidt boleh digunakan untuk memilih lajur-lajur yang tinggal.\n"
"Sesuatu yang serupa dilakukan dalam pelajaran *Litar kuantum* dalam \"Asas maklumat kuantum\" dalam konteks masalah pembezaan keadaan.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Stinespring representations back to the definition {#stinespring-"
"representations-back-to-the-definition}"
msgstr ""
"Perwakilan Stinespring kembali kepada takrifan {#stinespring-"
"representations-back-to-the-definition}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The final implication is 4 $\\Rightarrow$ 1.\n"
"That is, we assume that we have a unitary operation transforming a pair of systems $(\\mathsf{W},\\mathsf{X})$ into a pair\n"
"$(\\mathsf{G},\\mathsf{Y}),$ and our goal is to conclude that the mapping\n"
msgstr ""
"Implikasi terakhir ialah 4 $\\Rightarrow$ 1.\n"
"Iaitu, kita andaikan bahawa kita mempunyai operasi unitari yang mengubah pasangan sistem $(\\mathsf{W},\\mathsf{X})$ kepada pasangan\n"
"$(\\mathsf{G},\\mathsf{Y}),$ dan matlamat kita ialah untuk menyimpulkan bahawa pemetaan\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\Phi(\\rho) = \\operatorname{Tr}_{\\mathsf{G}} \\bigl( U (\\vert 0\\rangle \\langle 0 \\vert_{\\mathsf{W}} \\otimes \\rho)U^{\\dagger}\\bigr)\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\Phi(\\rho) = \\operatorname{Tr}_{\\mathsf{G}} \\bigl( U (\\vert 0\\rangle \\langle 0 \\vert_{\\mathsf{W}} \\otimes \\rho)U^{\\dagger}\\bigr)\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"is a valid channel.\n"
"From its form, it is evident that $\\Phi$ is linear, and it remains to verify that it always transforms density matrices into density matrices.\n"
"This is pretty straightforward and we've already discussed the key points.\n"
msgstr ""
"ialah saluran yang sah.\n"
"Daripada bentuknya, jelas bahawa $\\Phi$ adalah linear, dan tinggal lagi untuk mengesahkan bahawa ia sentiasa mengubah matriks ketumpatan kepada matriks ketumpatan.\n"
"Ini agak mudah dan kita sudah membincangkan perkara-perkara utamanya.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In particular, if we start with a density matrix $\\sigma$ of a compound system $(\\mathsf{Z},\\mathsf{X}),$ and then add on an additional workspace system $\\mathsf{W},$ we will certainly be left with a density matrix.\n"
"If we reorder the systems $(\\mathsf{W},\\mathsf{Z},\\mathsf{X})$ for convenience, we can write this state as\n"
msgstr ""
"Khususnya, jika kita bermula dengan matriks ketumpatan $\\sigma$ bagi sistem kompaun $(\\mathsf{Z},\\mathsf{X}),$ dan kemudian menambah sistem ruang kerja tambahan $\\mathsf{W},$ kita pasti akan kekal dengan matriks ketumpatan.\n"
"Jika kita susun semula sistem $(\\mathsf{W},\\mathsf{Z},\\mathsf{X})$ untuk kemudahan, kita boleh tulis keadaan ini sebagai\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert 0\\rangle\\langle 0\\vert_{\\mathsf{W}} \\otimes \\sigma.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\vert 0\\rangle\\langle 0\\vert_{\\mathsf{W}} \\otimes \\sigma.\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We then apply the unitary operation $U,$ and as we already discussed this is a valid channel, and hence maps density matrices to density matrices.\n"
"Finally, the partial trace of a density matrix is another density matrix.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita kemudian menerapkan operasi unitari $U,$ dan seperti yang sudah kita bincangkan ini adalah saluran yang sah, dan oleh itu memetakan matriks ketumpatan kepada matriks ketumpatan.\n"
"Akhirnya, surih separa matriks ketumpatan ialah matriks ketumpatan yang lain.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Another way to say this is to observe first that each of these things is a "
"valid channel:\n"
msgstr ""
"Cara lain untuk menyatakan ini ialah dengan memerhatikan terlebih dahulu "
"bahawa setiap perkara berikut ialah saluran yang sah:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Introducing an initialized workspace system.\n"
msgstr "Memperkenalkan sistem ruang kerja yang diinisialisasi.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Performing a unitary operation.\n"
msgstr "Melakukan operasi unitari.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Tracing out a system.\n"
msgstr "Mensurih keluar sistem.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"And finally, any composition of channels is another channel — which is "
"immediate from the definition, but is also a fact worth observing in its own"
" right.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dan akhirnya, sebarang komposisi saluran ialah saluran yang lain — yang "
"segera mengikut dari takrifan, tetapi juga merupakan fakta yang patut "
"diperhatikan dengan sendirinya.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This completes the proof of the final implication, and therefore we've "
"established the equivalence of the four statements listed at the start of "
"the section.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ini melengkapkan bukti implikasi terakhir, dan oleh itu kita telah "
"menetapkan kesetaraan empat pernyataan yang disenaraikan pada permulaan "
"bahagian ini.\n"
